name valley_far_v
describe Prompt 007 goal 343. valley_far's pose, swept across the named visibility bands. Run it with `--ramp visibility:10000,20000,50000,100000` -- the eye research's light-haze, clear, very-clear and exceptional values -- and the four captures are the fog's whole authored range at one pose.
backend both

option --no-taa
option --no-auto-exposure
option --visibility 20000

pose_ground 48,0 -90 -8 12
wait 2

capture end valley_far_v no-golden

assert frames > 0
assert contrast_percent > 6
